# The CLI uploads everything except its own short default list (it does not
# read .gitignore). Each upload counts towards the team's Deployment Storage,
# so leave out what the build never reads: plan docs and their screenshots
# (about 42 MB), agent tooling, offline scripts and evals.
/docs
/.agents
/.claude
/scripts
/evals
/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
.env*
!.env.example
/ios
/native
